{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Form is compatible with various front-end frameworks, including React, Vue, Angular, Solid, Lit, and Svelte. Install the corresponding adapter for your framework using your preferred package manager:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-managers"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/react-form@alpha\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@tanstack/angular-form@alpha\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@tanstack/preact-form@alpha\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@tanstack/vue-form@alpha\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@tanstack/solid-form@alpha\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@tanstack/svelte-form@alpha\"]],\"lit\":[[\"@tanstack/lit-form@alpha\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"meta-frameworks","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Meta-frameworks"}],"framework":"react"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you're using a meta-framework, TanStack Form provides additional adapters to streamline integration:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Start"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next.js"}]}]}]}]}],"properties":{"data-available-frameworks":"[\"react\"]","data-framework-meta":"{\"codeBlocksByFramework\":{\"react\":[]}}"}},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/react-form-start@alpha\"],[\"@tanstack/react-form-nextjs@alpha\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Devtools"}],"framework":"react"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Developer tools are available using "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":". Install the devtools adapter for your framework as a dev dependency to debug forms and inspect their state."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"solid"},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"devtools-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Devtools"}],"framework":"solid"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Developer tools are available using "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":". Install the devtools adapter for your framework as a dev dependency to debug forms and inspect their state."}]}]}],"properties":{"data-available-frameworks":"[\"react\",\"solid\"]","data-framework-meta":"{\"codeBlocksByFramework\":{\"react\":[],\"solid\":[]}}"}},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/react-devtools@alpha\"],[\"@tanstack/react-form-devtools@alpha\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"[!NOTE]- Polyfill requirements\nDepending on your environment, you might need to add polyfills. If you want to support older browsers, you need to transpile the library from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"node_modules"},{"type":"text","value":" yourself."}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"meta-frameworks","text":"Meta-frameworks","level":2,"framework":"react"},{"id":"devtools","text":"Devtools","level":2,"framework":"react"},{"id":"devtools-2","text":"Devtools","level":2,"framework":"solid"}]},"frameworks":["react","solid","angular","preact","vue","svelte","lit"],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Form is compatible with various front-end frameworks, including React, Vue, Angular, Solid, Lit, and Svelte. Install the corresponding adapter for your framework using your preferred package manager:\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-managers\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-form@alpha\nangular: @tanstack/angular-form@alpha\npreact: @tanstack/preact-form@alpha\nvue: @tanstack/vue-form@alpha\nsolid: @tanstack/solid-form@alpha\nsvelte: @tanstack/svelte-form@alpha\nlit: @tanstack/lit-form@alpha\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n## Meta-frameworks\n\nIf you're using a meta-framework, TanStack Form provides additional adapters to streamline integration:\n\n- TanStack Start\n- Next.js\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-form-start@alpha\nreact: @tanstack/react-form-nextjs@alpha\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n## Devtools\n\nDeveloper tools are available using [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest). Install the devtools adapter for your framework as a dev dependency to debug forms and inspect their state.\n\n# Solid\n\n## Devtools\n\nDeveloper tools are available using [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest). Install the devtools adapter for your framework as a dev dependency to debug forms and inspect their state.\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-devtools@alpha\nreact: @tanstack/react-form-devtools@alpha\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n> [!NOTE]- Polyfill requirements\n> Depending on your environment, you might need to add polyfills. If you want to support older browsers, you need to transpile the library from `node_modules` yourself.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: installation\ntitle: Installation\n---\n\nTanStack Form is compatible with various front-end frameworks, including React, Vue, Angular, Solid, Lit, and Svelte. Install the corresponding adapter for your framework using your preferred package manager:\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-managers\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-form@alpha\nangular: @tanstack/angular-form@alpha\npreact: @tanstack/preact-form@alpha\nvue: @tanstack/vue-form@alpha\nsolid: @tanstack/solid-form@alpha\nsvelte: @tanstack/svelte-form@alpha\nlit: @tanstack/lit-form@alpha\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n## Meta-frameworks\n\nIf you're using a meta-framework, TanStack Form provides additional adapters to streamline integration:\n\n- TanStack Start\n- Next.js\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-form-start@alpha\nreact: @tanstack/react-form-nextjs@alpha\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n## Devtools\n\nDeveloper tools are available using [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest). Install the devtools adapter for your framework as a dev dependency to debug forms and inspect their state.\n\n# Solid\n\n## Devtools\n\nDeveloper tools are available using [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest). Install the devtools adapter for your framework as a dev dependency to debug forms and inspect their state.\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-devtools@alpha\nreact: @tanstack/react-form-devtools@alpha\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n> [!NOTE]- Polyfill requirements\n> Depending on your environment, you might need to add polyfills. If you want to support older browsers, you need to transpile the library from `node_modules` yourself.\n"}
